---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 12px
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Tel as Telescope Position
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant OODS as OODS
    participant MTAOS as MTAOS
    participant Sub as Subsystems

    Note over Tel: Field F1<br/>el=70 rot=15

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
    Cam->>Cam: Exposure N (30s)
    end

    Cam->>OODS: Image N ingested
    OODS->>MTAOS: evt_imageInOODS

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
    Note over MTAOS: Position check<br/>image el=70 vs live el=70<br/>delta=0 ... PASSES
    end

    Note over Tel: Slew to F2<br/>el=65 rot=20
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
    Cam->>Cam: Exposure N+1 (30s)
    end

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
    MTAOS->>MTAOS: WEP processing (~37s)
    end

    Note over Tel: Slew to F3<br/>el=55 rot=30
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
    Cam->>Cam: Exposure N+2 (30s)
    end

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
    MTAOS->>MTAOS: OFC computation (3s)
    end

    MTAOS->>MTAOS: Wait shutter closed...

    Cam-->>MTAOS: Shutter closed (N+2 ends)

    rect rgb(255, 205, 210)
    Note over MTAOS: NO position re-check<br/>image was el=70<br/>telescope is now el=55<br/>delta=15 exceeds 9 threshold
    MTAOS->>Sub: Apply correction from image N
    Note over Sub: Correction for el=70<br/>applied at el=55
    end

    MTAOS->>MTAOS: time_last_correction = now

    Note over OODS: Image N+1 arrives
    OODS->>MTAOS: evt_imageInOODS (N+1)
    Note over MTAOS: N+1 started before<br/>last correction<br/>DISCARDED

    Note over OODS: Image N+2 arrives
    OODS->>MTAOS: evt_imageInOODS (N+2)
    Note over MTAOS: N+2 started before<br/>last correction<br/>DISCARDED

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
    Cam->>Cam: Exposure N+3 (30s)
    Note over MTAOS: N+3 starts after correction<br/>FIRST VALID IMAGE
    end
